        {
          "id": "the-key-question-does-it-crank-or-is-there-silence",
          "title": "The key question: does it crank or is there silence?",
          "description": "An engine that won't start is one of the most stressful situations for any driver. But here's the crucial distinction:",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "cards": [
                {
                  "title": "It cranks but won't start → £100-£900",
                  "text": "Fuel, spark, or compression issue. Usually fixable.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "It cranks but won't start → £100-£900 Fuel, spark, or compression issue. Usually fixable."
                },
                {
                  "title": "It doesn't crank → £60-£400",
                  "text": "Starter motor or battery issue. Usually fixable.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "It doesn't crank → £60-£400 Starter motor or battery issue. Usually fixable."
                },
                {
                  "title": "It won't turn at all → £1,500-£8,000+",
                  "text": "Engine seized. This is the nightmare scenario.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "It won't turn at all → £1,500-£8,000+ Engine seized. This is the nightmare scenario."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In our 24,650 quote dataset, 70% of no-start cases were battery, starter, or alternator issues - not catastrophic engine failure. However, 10% were seized engines , and these are the cases that require replacement."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The key diagnostic question: When you turn the key, does the engine crank (turn over) or is there silence?"
            },
            {
              "type": "label",
              "text": "Common affected vehicles & engines"
            }
          ],
          "links": [],
          "source": {
            "sectionId": "the-key-question-does-it-crank-or-is-there-silence",
            "order": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "follow-this-decision-tree-to-identify-the-cause",
          "title": "Follow this decision tree to identify the cause",
          "description": "ENGINE WON'T START │ ├─── Does it crank/turn over? │ │ │ ├── YES → Normal cranking speed? │ │ │ │ │ ├── YES → Fuel or spark issue → Fuel system / ignition │ │ │ │ │ └── NO → Slow cranking? │ │ │ │ │ ├── YES → Battery or starter → Battery / starter │ │ │ │ │ └── NO → No crank? │ │ │ │ │ ├── Clicking → Battery → Battery │ │ │ │ │ └── Silence → Starter → Starter motor │ │ │ └── NO → Try turning with socket/breaker bar │ │ │ ├── Turns freely → Battery/starter → Battery / starter │ │ │ └── Won't turn → SEIZED ENGINE → Engine replacement",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "If you suspect a seized engine, stop attempting to start immediately."
            },
            {
              "type": "label",
              "text": "No-start types & repair costs"
            }
          ],
          "links": [],
          "source": {
            "sectionId": "follow-this-decision-tree-to-identify-the-cause",
            "order": 4
          }
        }
      ]
    },
