          "id": "the-expensive-mistake-is-assuming-it-s-just-the-battery",
          "title": "The expensive mistake is assuming it's just the battery",
          "description": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "cards": [
                {
                  "title": "",
                  "text": "✕ “It's just the battery - I'll jump start it.” Jump starts can mask the problem. If it doesn't start after 3 attempts, stop before you damage the starter.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "✕ “It's just the battery - I'll jump start it.” Jump starts can mask the problem. If it doesn't start after 3 attempts, stop before you damage the starter."
                },
                {
                  "title": "",
                  "text": "✕ “Keep trying - it'll eventually start.” Repeated attempts flood petrol engines and can burn out starter motors.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "✕ “Keep trying - it'll eventually start.” Repeated attempts flood petrol engines and can burn out starter motors."
                },
                {
                  "title": "",
                  "text": "✕ “If it cranks, the battery is fine.” Not necessarily. Weak batteries can crank slowly but lack voltage for the ECU/injectors.",
                  "highlight": "",
                  "meta": "",
                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "✕ “If it cranks, the battery is fine.” Not necessarily. Weak batteries can crank slowly but lack voltage for the ECU/injectors."
                },
                {
                  "title": "",
                  "text": "✕ “A seized engine means I need a new car.” Not always - but you'll need a replacement engine (£1,500-£8,000) or a new car.",
                  "highlight": "",
